  dialogue:
  - Dialogue: Has your mom been treating you well?
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
  Charming_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "That\u2019s great to hear, I\u2019m glad everything seems to be
        smooth sailing."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: "I was worried that Grandpa\u2019s passing would throw everything
        for a loop."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b98f0011ea366da459066c9cc7eed3f8, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "We\u2019re right as rain just like we always are!"
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 10
  Assertive_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "I\u2019m sorry to hear that, just give your mother some time."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: "Your grandfather\u2019s passing is still fresh in her mind, I\u2019m
        sure..."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: but things will go back to normal eventually.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b98f0011ea366da459066c9cc7eed3f8, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "We\u2019ve been fighting a lot lately."
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 5
  Sappy_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "That\u2019s good. I\u2019ll talk to her to make sure she makes time
        for you."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: I know she has two jobs, but...
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: "That\u2019s no excuse not to have time for you."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b98f0011ea366da459066c9cc7eed3f8, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Yep, but I wish we were able to spend more time with each other.
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 5
  Charming_Observation:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "That\u2019s great to hear, I\u2019m glad everything seems to be
        smooth sailing."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: "I was worried that Grandpa\u2019s passing would throw everything
        for a loop."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b98f0011ea366da459066c9cc7eed3f8, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "As always, she\u2019s the one that\u2019s making sure I\u2019m
      staying on top of my training schedule."
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 15
  Assertive_Observation:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "Sorry, you\u2019re right, I guess I was just in my head a bit."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: You have to be focused if you want to help win that trophy.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b98f0011ea366da459066c9cc7eed3f8, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: 'That is an odd thing that bring up at a time like this. '
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -10
  Sappy_Observation:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: I was worried that might be the case...
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: Just give your mother some time.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: "I know we all need time after going through something like your
        grandfather\u2019s passing."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b98f0011ea366da459066c9cc7eed3f8, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "It\u2019s been a bit rough lately, I just hope that she isn\u2019t
      biting off more than she can chew."
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 10
  Charming_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "I was worried that Grandpa\u2019s passing might have thrown everyone
        off balance."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: "It\u2019s good to see and hear that's not the case."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b98f0011ea366da459066c9cc7eed3f8, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Things have been going great, what makes you bring that up?
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 5
  Assertive_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "Sorry, you\u2019re right, I guess I was just in my head a bit."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: You have to be focused if you want to help win that trophy.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b98f0011ea366da459066c9cc7eed3f8, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Why do you ask?
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 5
  Sappy_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "I was worried that Grandpa\u2019s passing might have thrown everyone
        off balance."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: "It\u2019s good to see and hear that\u2019s is not the case."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b98f0011ea366da459066c9cc7eed3f8, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Yeah, I just wish we could spend more time together. Is there
